    nuttx: support ESP32[|S2|S3|C3|C6|H2|P4] on NuttX

    This commit enables supporting the Espressif's ESP32, ESP32-S2,
    ESP32-S3, ESP32-C3, ESP32-C6 and ESP32-H2 and ESP32-P4 SoCs based
    on sync/master.b branch on NuttX.

    Signed-off-by: Tiago Medicci <tiago.medicci@espressif.com>

